						<p class="pDate">Thursday, May 01, 2003</p>
						<p class="pTitle">Blood Tide Recruiting Open </p>
							<p class=pText>
							Blood Tide is now open to recruiting. We have been in operation since september of 1999 and are a family oriented guild focused on high level zones without the attitude and selfishness of some other guilds. Loot whores, people looking for a quick epic gain, and self servers need not apply, as we base our rewards on merit and service to the guild and to each other.<br><br>We are presently seeking all classes, and have a level minimum of 55 with some exceptions. More information can be found on our forums.<br><br>Zalbar The Mad<br>Guildleader Blood Tide<br>HTTP://WWW.BLOODTIDE.COM
							<br>
							 - Zalbar<BR><BR>
							</p>
							&nbsp;<a class="abody" href="comments.asp?Index=381">[View Comments]</a>
					
					
