						<p class="pDate">Sunday, April 06, 2003</p>
						<p class="pTitle">A Corrupted Spawn </p>
							<p class=pText>
							I was hunting earlier this afternoon in LOIO for the druid epic. As I tried to get the corrupted spawned for the past few days I have been a little itchy about this. After being loged in game for 40mins today I got my tainted Pulled him to Shore and spawned the corrupted. I was an excited little druid about this. My Best friend who happens to be in my guild and also a druid was very excited. When I killed the corrupted a second tainted spawned and from that, another Corrupted. 2 Corrupted baracuda's in LOIO back to back, in 40mins. Thats interesting.<br><br>Kalest MoonGlade<br>54th wanderer of Tunare<br>Guardians of the Crystal Rose.
							<br>
							 - Kalest<BR><BR>
							</p>
							&nbsp;<a class="abody" href="comments.asp?Index=370">[View Comments]</a>
					
					
						<p class="pDate">Tuesday, March 25, 2003</p>
						<p class="pTitle">GM Event Lake Rathe </p>
							<p class=pText>
							There was some unusual activity in the Rathe Mountains. Seems that 2 named hill giants ( Glex and Glox ) had rallied all the other giants into an army. Over 50 of them were marching in parade formation before the slaughter commenced. After taking down the two named (that dropped 20 shurikens) Blood Tide proceeded to mass kill the other giants in the zone. Fun was had, we set up a ress station at the hill giant tower, and all in all an amusing evening. Grats to all the ppl that got muchas fundage from all the giants. :)<br><br>- Zalbar The Mad<br>Blood Tide<br>http://forums.bloodtide.org
							<br>
							 - Zalbar The Mad<BR><BR>
							</p>
							
					
						<p class="pDate">Friday, March 07, 2003</p>
						<p class="pTitle">Syndicate Ro looking to recruit Raid Leader! </p>
							<p class=pText>
							Syndicate Ro is advancing in level everyday but we are missing a very important person a raid leader. We are seeking someone about level 55 to 65 with at least 6 months of leading high end and epic raids with nerves of steel. Someone who can make groups and organize people with out getting stressed out or cranky.  We have the man power to back the raids just need a driven raid leader. If you think you possess the leadership skills and expiernce to take over a job with such amazing potential visit www.syndicatero.com. Please post on our ezboard under Syndicate Raids your qualifications and reason why you think you are best for the job. This position has amazing potential considering the number of raid ready members we have avaialable!
							<br>
							 - Zino<BR><BR>
							</p>
							&nbsp;<a class="abody" href="comments.asp?Index=367">[View Comments]</a>
					
					
