						<p class="pDate">Monday, April 29, 2002</p>
						<p class="pTitle">The Gnome's Revolt </p>
							<p class=pText>
							It begins...<br><br>All through the night you tossed and turned, waking on occasion you vaguely remember the dream that seems to be causing your restlessness. Now, the steam whistles are piping their discordant wake-up calls, the days work has begun in the factories and tunnels of Ak'Anon.<br><br>Rise and groan. Get dressed. Open the door and head to your work cubby with maps and blueprints tucked under your arm.<br><br><br>You will regret your lack of sleep later today. Nevermind that, you regret it now! One of your associates is coming towards you with what looks like yesterdays papers that you had completed, and he doesn't look happy. His yelling and shouting is lost to the banging and clanging of the nearby machinery. Upon further inspection of your work you don't see where there is a problem. He insists that it's wrong though, so you decide to rework it today before lunch.<br><br><br>You look up and notice sweat starting to bead up on his brow. He is standing in the same spot where he was yelling at you 10 minutes ago. Then, suddenly, he collapses in a heap on the floor.<br><br><br>You rush over to him to find that he is indeed alive, but is unconscious. <br><br><br>"Cleric!!", you yell. "We need a Cleric!", and the rest is a blur.<br><br>To be continued... <br><br>For more information please Check out The <a href=http://home.earthlink.net/~shadowintheattic/GnomeRevoltPreview.htm target=_TOP>Gathered Might </a> Web Page
							<br>
							 - Gharret Ardere<BR><BR>
							</p>
							
					
						<p class="pDate">Thursday, April 25, 2002</p>
						<p class="pTitle">WHOAH! </p>
							<p class=pText>
							Hey look! A NEW SSOTW! :)<br><br>Yes it has taken a long time to get that thing changes. Both Ganza and I have been pretty busy with RL and leveling sometimes of course.<br><br><br>As Far as the news section, please use it for World EQ news, and Sol Ro info like Guild events or any NEWS event you think we need to have :) Please do not post FOR SALE or gripes about players in the news, it will not get approved.<br><br><br>As for the new mail accounts that have to be added, about 400+ atm, we have been capped somehow by the hosting company. We are currently working on something to get that fixed. <br><br><br>Also, we are working on some new things here at the SolRo site. Taking ideas, so far we have a couple like a PRICE CHECK section for up to the day prices on select items on ONLY SolRo, a searchable database of the users on this site to see current levels and such, Adding some fields in the user profile to actually keep records of where your skills are etc... <br><br><br>If you have any more cool ideas, please email Anumatu at anumatu@solusekro.com or Ganza at ganza@solusekro.com<br><br><br>Would also like to thank Adrastea for he continued help with the GUILDS section of the site. I believe with her help we have the best list of guilds on the server.<br><br><br>Everyone should know that you can edit your profile at any time to change your info, except for name of course. So if you feel up to it UPDATE! :P<br>
							<br>
							 - Anumatu<BR><BR>
