						<p class="pTitle">Great New Guild </p>
							<p class=pText>
							A worn and tattered scroll reveals the lost Norrathian legend of the Majestic Partisans– a tribe of forgotten members who perished in the Battle of the Worlds.  The scroll reads – "Lost in the forests of Norrath, a tribe found their way to solidarity by embracing their kindred souls.  Within themselves they found their cause of nobility.   To protect their own ~ To strike down those who oppose.  Such dignity and aristocracy was possessed by those who took on the cause of the few - They came to be known as  the Majestic Partisans."    To take up the cause will require dedication and loyalty.  We believe in no concern with ugliness, or with the violent dealings deriving from the compelling power of necessity. And since we came to be, it is said, the delighting in beautiful things surpassed the dominion of necessity, bringing all kinds of benefits the citizens of Norrath.  We wish to speak what we feel.  We wish to speak what we think.  To those that join us – we are about FUN – we put our all into the pursuit of pleasure, riches, and personal satisfaction.   To those who oppose us - We are swift with our tongues and even swifter with our swords.  Beware!<br>Come Visit Our Site at www.majesticpartisans.8k.com.<br>
