						<p class="pTitle">Patch Message Today. </p>
							<p class=pText>
							Trade Skills:<BR><BR><BR>- Tailoring: More items have been added to the trade skill. The instructions on how to make the new items were also added. The difficulty of some tailor-made items was lowered making them easier to produce. New patterns now exist t round out the tailor-made items.<BR><BR><BR><BR>- Brewing: New liquor can now be made. The instructions are hinted at in the game.<BR><BR><BR><BR>- Pottery: The Mortar and Pestle is now droppable and Vials are now stackable<BR><BR><BR><BR>- Bowyer: More slots have been added to the Fletching Kit. Dual-cam bows have been added. <BR><BR><BR><BR>- Fletching: The range of normal store-bought arrows has been reduced. Players may now make a cheaper more effective arrow with the fletching skill. Nock vendors now sell all arrow components.<BR><BR><BR><BR>Items:<BR><BR>- Lustrous Russet Armor, the Hero Bracer, Order of Thunder and the Box of Abu-Kar have been returned to their previous statistics.<BR>
							<br>
							 - Aanamdar<BR><BR>
							</p>
							
					
						<p class="pDate">Monday, September 13, 1999</p>
						<p class="pTitle">New Patch </p>
							<p class=pText>
							Big New Patch: Spells Updated,Added. DOT/Pet Changes.<br>Get the Details <a href=news.htm>here</A>.
							<br>
							 - Ganza<BR><BR>
							</p>
							
					
						<p class="pDate">Thursday, September 09, 1999</p>
						<p class="pTitle">Spells, Spells and more Spells! </p>
							<p class=pText>
							We are in the process of completing the spells list here. Mostly the spells cost, reagents, and the recipe's =) If you happen to see one that isnt correct while we are in this process please let us know. Thanks!
							<br>
							 - Aanamdar<BR><BR>
							</p>
							
					
						<p class="pDate">Wednesday, September 08, 1999</p>
						<p class="pTitle">Attention Guilds! </p>
							<p class=pText>
							For those guilds that are not listed on the Guild page here, please send email to admin@solusekro.com with the link to your guild page or if you need page space here let us know. Thanks!<br>
							<br>
							 - Aanamdar<BR><BR>
							</p>
							
					
						<p class="pDate">Tuesday, September 07, 1999</p>
						<p class="pTitle">New Message Board Software </p>
							<p class=pText>
							We Upgraded the forum software and they're faster than ever check em out!<br>New features include Forum Subscriptions and Who's Online, you can see other people reading the board and send messages!
							<br>
							 - Ganza<BR><BR>
							</p>
							
<center>
<img src=images/redline.gif height=1 width=100%>				
</center>
					

						<p class="pTitle">Updates </p>
							<p class=pText>
							I updated the <a href="http://www.solusekro.com/eq/guilds.asp">Guild Page</a> with some additions that were sent to me via email. Also added a couple links in the <a href="http://www.solusekro.com/eq/links.asp">Links</a> page. Keep the suggestions rolling and thanks for the nice comments about the site! I want to try to get all the server events posted on the site, so if you are having an event please let us know. 
							<br>
							 - Aanamdar<BR><BR>
							</p>
							
					
						<p class="pDate">Sunday, September 05, 1999</p>
						<p class="pTitle">New Additions </p>
							<p class=pText>
							Well as you can see we have added a few more links in the Guild Section and have added a couple other pages. The Picture Gallery is for screen shots as well as Solusek Ro artists pics. So send the pics in =) Also we are looking for suggestions on how you want the Server Event page to look, so if ya have one feel free to send us some mail! Thanks again and Good hunting!<br><BR>
							<br>
							 - Aanamdar<BR><BR>
							</p>
							
					
						<p class="pDate">Friday, September 03, 1999</p>
						<p class="pTitle">Links Section </p>
							<p class=pText>
							New Friends of Soluesek page has been added, it is our link page. =) Go <a href="http://www.solusekro.com/eq/links.asp">here</a> to get to it for now . Thank you to Everlore.com!
							<br>
							 - Aanamdar<BR><BR>
							</p>
							
<center>
<img src=images/redline.gif height=1 width=100%>				
</center>
					

						<p class="pTitle">A wonderous Adventure come forth! </p>
							<p class=pText>
							Today I recieved this news from Atlus Baldrickson : <BR><BR> <BR><BR>Many months ago, a demon rose to power quietly in Norrath.<BR>This demon had the sole intent to resurrect a long forgotten<BR>goddess of destruction to the land of Norrath.<BR>The event however never was followed through and my brothers and I <BR>took out the beast with vast effort.<BR>New dangers arise in our land once more.<BR>Norrath is threatened by the same goddess but with a mind by far more foul.<BR>Recently, a paladin of srict code passed away.<BR>His name was Banegrivm, leader of Knights of Justice.<BR>One night, several days after burying Bane, we arise out of bed in the still of the night to dash off to the graveyard.<BR>Upon entering we find his grave dug up and no Banegrivm.<BR>We immediately dressed into our gear and rode out into the now silent night, Embarking on what was the first night of a path which we thought had ended.<BR>Finding no Bane, our wizard and scholar of the order, Glabrin, came back from Erudin with news of necromancer uphevals and stories of a reborn group whom claimed they had the power to pull souls from the land of beyond where people were exactly the opposite of what they had been.<BR>Intrigued I set out to find more information.<BR>I found more than I would have liked to.<BR>Bane had been resurrected with the same dark arts and now the dearly loved paladin was a horrid warmonger, lusting for death and destruction.<BR>What was worse is that a small following told Bane of Kardis, the goddess of destruction and Bane set out upon his quest to resurrect Kardis.<BR>We now find ourselves in a race against all that would bring an end to the beauty of Norrath.<BR>We call upon all in Norrath to aide us against all evil opposing the power of justice and light.<BR>May Justice be served and The Tribunal's wish fulfilled!<BR><BR> <BR><BR>Atlus Baldrickson<BR>Wolf of The North<BR><BR> <BR><BR>OOC-  this is a server wide rp going into the making.  This weekend of 9/3 there will be a KOJ event in Blackburrow to find a ring, one of the many quest items Bane and his allies must retrieve to win.<BR>This will pit all Evil against Good.<BR>and hopefully we can get The Order of Solusek Ro and The Dark Souls in on it huh? =)<BR>Come on guys...lets build a quest to knock the socks off all other servers and show all we have the BEST server!<BR><BR>
							<br>
							 - Aanamdar<BR><BR>
							</p>
							
<center>
<img src=images/redline.gif height=1 width=100%>				
</center>
					

						<p class="pTitle">Nagafen again! </p>
							<p class=pText>
							Just in from Averon:<BR><BR>Lord Nagafen was killed on 9/2 by HOSS with only 18 people! I wonder if they are going to beef him up like they did the Fear Plane. Let's hope not, the druids need that crook =) Good job guys!
							<br>
							 - Aanamdar<BR><BR>
							</p>
							
					
						<p class="pDate">Thursday, September 02, 1999</p>
						<p class="pTitle">It's Official </p>
							<p class=pText>
							We are opening the site officially now, I think we have worked out most of bugs. So today we open our doors to everyone. Hope you enjoy your stay =) And Thanks!
							<br>
							 - Aanamdar<BR><BR>
							</p>
							
					
						<p class="pDate">Wednesday, September 01, 1999</p>
						<p class="pTitle">Server Problems </p>
							<p class=pText>
							Sorry the site was down, it was due to our provider. Their hardware went wacko. ;) Back to work as usual.
							<br>
							 - Aanamdar<BR><BR>
							</p>
							
<center>
<img src=images/redline.gif height=1 width=100%>				
</center>
					

						<p class="pTitle">Lord Nagafen DEAD! </p>
							<p class=pText>
							Last night three of the most power guilds on our server grouped up to slay this mighty beast. Heroes of the Seven Suns(HOSS), Phoenix, and Rest in Peace. It was a long battle, lead by Sorn, and it ended in VICTORY! Congratulations guys, and yes I was in Solusek B at the time of the battle, it was intense! I just wish I had remembered to /log. The loot was the Cloak of Fire, Hammer of Blight, Hierophant's Crook, and a Rune(don't think it was for Ice Comet). On to Vox and Cazic Thule I say!! :)<BR><BR>
							<br>
							 - Aanamdar<BR><BR>
							</p>
							
					
						<p class="pDate">Saturday, August 21, 1999</p>
						<p class="pTitle">New Site Design! </p>
							<p class=pText>
							Well we got a new facelift, and added quite a few more things to the site. The logon is your email logon and password. Its going to be used to change your user profile on the page. Also, we have items for sale button to post your items for sale on the server. Play tips! Hoping next week to be advertising a little and letting everyone know we are here. We have also added the user comments to the spells list. So now you can let everyone know what you think of a spell, and how powerful or useless it is, or even what kind of situation you would use it in =) Have Fun! <br>
							<br>
							 - Aanamdar<BR><BR>
							</p>
							
					
						<p class="pDate">Thursday, August 05, 1999</p>
						<p class="pTitle">Spell List </p>
							<p class=pText>
							As you can see the spells list is nearly complete. We plan on having one of the most complete and up to date lists available. It is a slow going process at the moment, but everything seems to be going as planned. Any comments on what you the users would want to see please feel free to let us know! <br>
							<br>
							 - Aanamdar<BR><BR>
							</p>
							
					
						<p class="pDate">Thursday, July 15, 1999</p>
						<p class="pTitle">Work Goes On </p>
							<p class=pText>
							The Site is still under major construction but we do have the Spells, Maps, Free Email (@solusekro.com), and Message Boards sections now online! <br>
							<br>
							 - Peej<BR><BR>
							</p>
							
					
						<p class="pDate">Monday, June 21, 1999</p>
						<p class="pTitle">Get Your Email </p>
							<p class=pText>
							Please be aware! This site is in ongoing construction for the next two weeks or so. We will be handing out the email addresses while work in progress. Thank you for your time. 
							<br>
							 - Peej<BR><BR>
							</p>
							
					
						<p class="pDate">Friday, June 18, 1999</p>
						<p class="pTitle">New Site </p>
							<p class=pText>
							Greetings fellow citizens of Norrath, This is a new site dedicated to serve the Solusek Ro server of EQ. Within no time we shall hope to have this place be a good meeting spot for our people. As you can see you will also be given a free email account for your primary character on this server, and also all of your others on Alias for the email. Please feel free to browse around and Good Hunting to you all! 
							<br>
							 - Aanamdar<BR><BR>
							</p>
							
